---
import WorkshopLayout from '../../../layouts/WorkshopLayout.astro';
---
<WorkshopLayout
  title="Privacy Notice — AI Literacy Workshop | CTW Studio"
  description="Privacy notice for the CTW Studio AI Literacy Workshop. GDPR Art. 13 compliant."
  canonical="/workshop/privacy/"
  legal
>
  <main id="main-content" class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 pt-32">

    <a href="/workshop/" class="workshop-back-link inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors mb-8">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 16l-4-4m0 0l4-4m-4 4h18"></path>
      </svg>
      Back to Workshop
    </a>

    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-12">Privacy Notice</h1>

    <section class="mb-10" id="data-controller">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-400 mb-3">1. Data Controller</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">CTW Studio, operated by Jesse Gonzalez. Contact: <a href="mailto:contact@ctw.studio" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">contact@ctw.studio</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10" id="what-we-collect">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-400 mb-3">2. What We Collect</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Name, email address, institutional affiliation -- collected via email correspondence during the booking process.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10" id="why-we-collect">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-400 mb-3">3. Why We Collect It</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">To deliver the workshop service, send pre-workshop preparation instructions, provide post-workshop materials, and issue invoices.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-300 mt-2">Legal basis: performance of a contract (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR).</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10" id="who-we-share-with">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-400 mb-3">4. Who We Share It With</h2>
      <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-2 ml-4">
        <li><span class="text-white font-medium">Vercel Inc.</span> -- website hosting</li>
        <li><span class="text-white font-medium">Your email provider</span> -- processes correspondence</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-gray-300 mt-3">We do not sell or share personal data with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10" id="data-retention">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-400 mb-3">5. How Long We Keep It</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Registration data is retained for 12 months after the workshop for follow-up and accounting purposes, then deleted. Invoicing records are retained for 7 years as required by Dutch tax law.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10" id="your-rights">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-400 mb-3">6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 mb-3">Under GDPR, you have the right to:</p>
      <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-2 ml-4">
        <li>Access your data</li>
        <li>Rectify inaccurate data</li>
        <li>Request deletion</li>
        <li>Restrict processing</li>
        <li>Data portability</li>
        <li>Lodge a complaint with the Dutch Data Protection Authority (Autoriteit Persoonsgegevens)</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10" id="contact">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-400 mb-3">7. Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">For any privacy-related requests, contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@ctw.studio" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">contact@ctw.studio</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-16">Last updated: March 2026</p>

  </main>

</WorkshopLayout>
